// Resource table of mxrun.exe. One icon group (ordinal 1) with 10 sizes
// (16..256, see tools/derive-icon-assets.py) — Explorer picks the best match for
// list / details / large / extra-large views instead of resampling one bitmap.
// The path is relative to the include dir build.rs passes (`-I icon`): windres does
// not search the .rc's own directory for ICON sources.
1 ICON "mxrun.ico"
